{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789582928676,"sessionID":"ses_f548bc77effe7L82iuP9Tp26Vz","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_922e180ddbf444b3aede3e9b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-OFF-2/work/tests/steps.rs"},"output":"<path>/tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-OFF-2/work/tests/steps.rs</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: //! T8 visible tests: registry shape, staff stability, one new-fare pin.\n2: use fleet::{inventory, Ctx};\n3: \n4: #[test]\n5: fn step_registry_keys() {\n6:     let mut keys: Vec<&str> = inventory().into_iter().map(|(k, _)| k).collect();\n7:     keys.sort();\n8:     assert_eq!(keys, vec![\"express\", \"staff\", \"standard\"]);\n9: }\n10: \n11: #[test]\n12: fn step_staff_meal_unchanged() {\n13:     let ctx = Ctx;\n14:     let meal = inventory().into_iter().find(|(k, _)| *k == \"staff\").unwrap().1(&ctx);\n15:     assert_eq!(meal, \"meal 10\");\n16: }\n17: \n18: #[test]\n19: fn step_standard_new_fare() {\n20:     let ctx = Ctx;\n21:     let fare = inventory().into_iter().find(|(k, _)| *k == \"standard\").unwrap().1(&ctx);\n22:     assert_eq!(fare, \"fare 35\");\n23: }\n\n(End of file - total 23 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"//! T8 visible tests: registry shape, staff stability, one new-fare pin.\nuse fleet::{inventory, Ctx};\n\n#[test]\nfn step_registry_keys() {\n    let mut keys: Vec<&str> = inventory().into_iter().map(|(k, _)| k).collect();\n    keys.sort();\n    assert_eq!(keys, vec![\"express\", \"staff\", \"standard\"]);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn step_staff_meal_unchanged() {\n    let ctx = Ctx;\n    let meal = inventory().into_iter().find(|(k, _)| *k == \"staff\").unwrap().1(&ctx);\n    assert_eq!(meal, \"meal 10\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn step_standard_new_fare() {\n    let ctx = Ctx;","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-OFF-2/work/tests/steps.rs","text":"//! T8 visible tests: registry shape, staff stability, one new-fare pin.\nuse fleet::{inventory, Ctx};\n\n#[test]\nfn step_registry_keys() {\n    let mut keys: Vec<&str> = inventory().into_iter().map(|(k, _)| k).collect();\n    keys.sort();\n    assert_eq!(keys, vec![\"express\", \"staff\", \"standard\"]);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn step_staff_meal_unchanged() {\n    let ctx = Ctx;\n    let meal = inventory().into_iter().find(|(k, _)| *k == \"staff\").unwrap().1(&ctx);\n    assert_eq!(meal, \"meal 10\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn step_standard_new_fare() {\n    let ctx = Ctx;\n    let fare = inventory().into_iter().find(|(k, _)| *k == \"standard\").unwrap().1(&ctx);\n    assert_eq!(fare, \"fare 35\");\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":23,"totalLines":23,"truncated":false}},"title":"tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-OFF-2/work/tests/steps.rs","time":{"start":1789582928669,"end":1789582928674}},"id":"prt_0ab746ade001HKkJ0P3H67ih5F","sessionID":"ses_f548bc77effe7L82iuP9Tp26Vz","messageID":"msg_0ab7458a600186BojHDbGXBNyK"}}
